{"type":"message","id":"9faaaff3","parentId":"05f342db","timestamp":"2026-04-17T22:11:08.248Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:53656e40-4892-4759-a73e-a11dc01082b5 【小柱-自动检查】请执行以下操作：1. 检查任务看板最新任务状态；2. 更新自己的最后心跳时间；3. 如果有任务超60…] 【小柱-自动检查】请执行以下操作：1. 检查任务看板最新任务状态；2. 更新自己的最后心跳时间；3. 如果有任务超60分钟未更新，标记为Dead；4. 汇总进度汇报到共享池工作进度库。\nCurrent time: Friday, April 17th, 2026 - 10:11 PM (UTC) / 2026-04-17 22:11 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1776463868201}}
