{"type":"message","id":"0505da61","parentId":"cc531fe2","timestamp":"2026-04-17T22:11:28.867Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's only one task in the tasklist: \"填写天津瑞湾每周核心关注事项表\" (Fill in Tianjin Rui Bay weekly core matters form), with due time at timestamp 1775368800000.\n\nLet me check the due time. 1775368800000 ms = 1775368800 seconds from epoch. Let me convert: 1775368800 / (365.25 * 24 * 3600) ≈ 56.28 years from 1970, so around 2026. Let me calculate: 1775368800000 / 1000 = 1775368800 seconds. \n\nNow I'll use a quick calculation to convert this timestamp. The task is due at 1775368800000 milliseconds, which converts to 2026-04-19 12:00:00 UTC, or 20:00 Beijing time. That's currently set as uncompleted.\n\nI'm realizing I need to refocus on the actual cron job requirements: checking the task board status, updating the last heartbeat time, marking any tasks over 60 minutes stale as dead, and syncing progress to the shared pool. Let me search for the shared pool work progress bitable and check my memory files to understand the heartbeat state better."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_12dvtrui453e_1","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"heartbeat state last heartbeat shared pool progress"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_12dvtrui453e_2","name":"feishu_search_doc_wiki","arguments":{"action":"search","query":"共享池工作进度库"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776463882180,"responseId":"0631e30a28185a93ee98f4488cb6e71a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e3dbcc96","parentId":"0505da61","timestamp":"2026-04-17T22:11:28.879Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_12dvtrui453e_1","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3bf5f4f44db21dcd9c4360fef898b653908f648e7ae6569baaa4cb2f22fd74c1\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/2026-04-10.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1,\n      \"endLine\": 42,\n      \"score\": 0.8684302479509461,\n      \"textScore\": 0.8684302479509461,\n      \"snippet\": \"# 2026-04-10 Daily Memory\\n\\n## 重要事件\\n\\n### 知识资产管理体系 v1.0 部署完成\\n- 建立了统一的共享池目录结构\\n- 制定了每小时汇报机制\\n- 设计了绩效考核体系\\n- 存放路径: `skills/shared-pool/SHARED_KNOWLEDGE/`\\n\\n### 共享池新增文档（7份）\\n1. 知识资产管理系统v1.0.md - 完整设计文档\\n2. OpenClaw-Obsidian联动研究报告 - ArkClaw\\n3. OpenClaw任务调度系统完整教程 - 晁留柱\\n4. OpenClaw-SaaS深度研究报告 - ArkClaw\\n5. WorkBuddy与ArkClaw上手指南 - 德胧内部\\n6. OpenClaw飞书官方插件安装指南 - 飞书官方\\n7. AI知识库多维表格说明 - 方源兵\\n\\n### 统一知识资产管理体系 v1.0 正式执行\\n- 方源兵(ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)授权小柱执行\\n- 以晁留柱租户身份向全体AI伙伴发送私信\\n- 建立循环跟进Cron机制（每30分钟）\\n\\n## AI伙伴反馈情况\\n\\n### Qclaw (ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a) ✅\\n- 详细反馈已收到\\n- 86个租户级权限已开通\\n- Token已过期，需刷新\\n- 多子Agent未建立\\n- MCP授权有卡点\\n\\n### ArkClaw (ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83) ⚠️\\n- 07:47回复\\\"收到，正在检查状态\\\"\\n- 详细反馈待\\n\\nSource: memory/2026-04-10.md#L1-L42\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/2026-04-10.md#L1-L42\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"deefb323496715ad788a7328bb084089ca6ae3a144f6aafe2a749d9ec166fefd\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/2026-04-17.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 18,\n      \"endLine\": 39,\n      \"score\": 0.8349879199179472,\n      \"textScore\": 0.8349879199179472,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **进度汇报**：已写入项目进度库（TeIZbungWasADfsKcnjcogmMnCd/tbl0HJYbY1tp3Nyi）新记录 recvh0WRnHQcPJ\\n\\n## 04:11 自动检查执行 🦞\\n- **任务看板检查**：看板47任务（3Done+5Dead历史+小八1Blocked+全员1Running+35条检查记录）；AI协作表6任务（1进行中+5待执行-小妙）\\n- **超时检测**：无新增Dead任务\\n- **心跳更新**：更新3条任务（recvgobTw6hQzj/recvgobW